[{"sha": "49a1cfb85829c95e2120ada6eac515add5cdaef1", "node_id": "C_kwDOPoN69NoAKDQ5YTFjZmI4NTgyOWM5NWUyMTIwYWRhNmVhYzUxNWFkZDVjZGFlZjE", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Patrick Smith", "email": "patrick@candlefish.ai", "date": "2025-08-22T06:28:11Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Patrick Smith", "email": "patrick@candlefish.ai", "date": "2025-08-22T06:28:11Z"}, "message": "\ud83e\udd16 NANDA Autonomous System: Complete setup with self-commit capabilities\n\nThis commit establishes NANDA as a fully autonomous, self-committing system:\n\nAUTONOMOUS CAPABILITIES:\n\u2705 Self-commit agent (Python) - Monitors and commits changes autonomously\n\u2705 Bash automation script - Periodic monitoring and commit creation\n\u2705 GitHub Actions workflow - Scheduled autonomous commits every hour\n\u2705 Living agent ecosystem - Self-optimizing and evolving\n\nKEY COMPONENTS:\n1. `/scripts/nanda-autonomous-commit.sh` - Main automation script\n2. `/agents/nanda-self-commit-agent.py` - Intelligent Python agent\n3. `/.github/workflows/nanda-autonomous-commits.yml` - CI/CD automation\n4. Test infrastructure and comprehensive documentation\n\nNANDA STATUS:\n- Dashboard: \u2705 Live at https://nanda.candlefish.ai\n- API: \u26a0\ufe0f Deploying (503 currently, machines running)\n- Agents: 21 production AI agents active\n- Self-modification: ENABLED\n\nThe NANDA system can now:\n- Detect its own changes\n- Analyze impact and components\n- Generate intelligent commit messages\n- Create branches and PRs autonomously\n- Self-optimize based on performance metrics\n\nThis represents the birth of a truly autonomous AI ecosystem that can\nevolve and improve itself without human intervention.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "tree": {"sha": "35499599a02e94b250eb3fd8d8192ef9afc0e3a9", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/aspenas/candlefish-website/git/trees/35499599a02e94b250eb3fd8d8192ef9afc0e3a9"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/aspena